  "body": "## What\n- install a headless-only BrowserContext route guard\n- abort only `image` and `media` subresources while the top-level page is the real `https://*.vinted.pl/catalog` surface\n- never block document/script/style/XHR/fetch traffic\n- keep common Cloudflare/hCaptcha/reCAPTCHA challenge asset hosts available\n- fail open if route classification is uncertain\n- add pure policy regression tests for catalog scope, functional resource types, lookalike hosts and challenge exceptions\n\n## Why\nEach active Chromium tree is currently heavy. FlipBot's catalog scanner reads image URLs from DOM `src` attributes and does not inspect decoded image pixels, so downloading/decoding catalog thumbnails is avoidable memory/GPU/network work. The optimization is intentionally restricted to headless catalog browsing and does not affect login, inbox, item-detail pages, or saved sessions.",
  "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:42:22Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-09-14T17:44:22Z",
